     7248             sym1  sym2 string(b-code) @ tb-code sym3 sym4 ('  /'+ gds-prt.f-name)  @  gds_name  sym5 sym6
     7249             Price sym7   buf_gds-dtl.fact-qnty @ qnty  sym8 (buf_gds-dtl.fact-qnty * Price ) @ stoim  sym10
