     7351                 sym3 buf_goods.artic
     7352                 sym4 gds_name
     7353                 sym5
     7354                 sym6 Price
     7355                 sym7 qnty
     7356                 sym8 stoim
     7357                 sym10
     7358               with frame rubl.
     7359               display stream out_stream  with frame rubl.
